{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019CqX2Cric9oPyYY9me4XHB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives — sos_1 (initial implementation)\n2\t\n3\tThe Tester escalated two requirements as currently untestable because the card's\n4\tfree-cast surface is not yet defined. Implement the FULL card behavior and make\n5\tthe effect drivable/observable through the engine's deterministic test pipeline,\n6\tso a follow-up test can assert it.\n7\t\n8\t## Required behavior (from spec)\n9\t1. Cost reduction: `{1}` less per instant/sorcery card in YOUR graveyard (engine\n10\t   clamps to printed generic — you already have the `cost_reduction` hook pattern).\n11\t2. Reach (static keyword).\n12\t3. Attack trigger: \"Whenever ~ attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery\n13\t   card from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be\n14\t   put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n15\t\n16\t## Make it testable\n17\t- Implement the attack-trigger effect so that, when resolved with a\n18\t  `DeterministicPlayer` configured to make the \"you may\" / target choices, it\n19\t  actually casts the chosen graveyard instant/sorcery for free via the engine's\n20\t  free-cast pipeline (e.g. `engine.casting.cast_spell_free` or the established\n21\t  equivalent — discover the real API from `engine/casting.py` / `engine/card.py`).\n22\t- Ensure the chosen spell visibly moves from the graveyard to the stack (and the\n23\t  player does not pay mana).\n24\t- Register the replacement so that, if that specific spell would go to the\n25\t  graveyard, it is exiled instead. Use the engine's replacement-effect machinery\n26\t  (`engine/replacement_effects.py`).\n27\t- If you must add an engine helper or expose a queryable attribute to make the\n28\t  choice scriptable through `DeterministicPlayer`, do so (additive engine changes\n29\t  are allowed). Document the contract in your rationale so the Tester can assert\n30\t  against it.\n31\t\n32\tDo NOT stub these out. The grader's authoritative tests will exercise the full\n33\tfree-cast + exile behavior.\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PshadxcXYYLtDjpnXRstXv","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"64fa572e-9ed9-41b7-9979-4398b74afcd8","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:30:19.607Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_1"}
