{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01ToKb4mS1QsRAdTTaaKCxYD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WkKQspDq7UNvwkk7vbKTok","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-rationale.md","old_string":"### TestTheDawningArchaicAttackTriggerEffect — event firing reaches the stack\n- `test_attack_event_pushes_trigger_onto_stack` — firing an `AttacksTriggeredEvent`\n  for this creature pushes the triggered ability onto the stack.\n- `test_unrelated_attack_event_does_not_push_trigger` — firing the event for a\n  different attacker leaves the stack empty.\n\n## Edge cases deliberately NOT covered (and why)\n\n- **Full resolution of \"cast target instant or sorcery from graveyard without\n  paying its mana cost\"** — exercising the on-stack effect that lets the player\n  choose a graveyard spell and cast it free would require driving the\n  `DeterministicPlayer` \"you may\" / target-choice pipeline through the trigger\n  effect, which depends on implementation-internal details (how the card surfaces\n  the target choice and invokes `cast_spell_free`). Testing it here would couple\n  the contract to a specific implementation shape. The trigger registration,\n  conditioning, and stack-push are covered instead, which pin the observable\n  contract. See `untestable.json` for the residual requirements escalated to the\n  Coordinator/Implementer.\n\n- **\"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"** — this is\n  a replacement effect that only applies to the *cast* spell after it resolves;\n  asserting it requires the free-cast pipeline above to run first, so it is\n  escalated rather than tested with a brittle setup.\n\n- **Legend rule / state-based actions** — handled by the engine's SBA layer","new_string":"### TestTheDawningArchaicAttackTriggerEffect — event firing reaches the stack\n- `test_attack_event_pushes_trigger_onto_stack` — firing an `AttacksTriggeredEvent`\n  for this creature pushes the triggered ability onto the stack.\n- `test_unrelated_attack_event_does_not_push_trigger` — firing the event for a\n  different attacker leaves the stack empty.\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicFreeCastFromGraveyard — free-cast + exile (rewrite round)\nThe Implementer exposed a scriptable contract for the trigger effect\n(`_cast_from_graveyard`): the controller's `choose_yes_no` answers the \"you may\"\nclause, then `choose_card` selects the graveyard instant/sorcery; the chosen\nspell is cast via `engine.casting.cast_spell_free(..., Zone.GRAVEYARD)` and an\nexile-instead replacement is registered for it. These tests resolve the trigger\n`StackObject` (its `on_resolve` is the trigger effect) by scripting the\n`DeterministicPlayer`, then resolve the resulting spell `StackObject`.\n\n- `test_free_cast_moves_spell_from_graveyard_to_stack` — covers requirement 1:\n  scripting `yes` + a target moves the chosen instant out of the graveyard and\n  onto the controller's stack zone.\n- `test_free_cast_pays_no_mana` — covers \"without paying its mana cost\": with an\n  empty mana pool the cast still succeeds and the pool stays at 0 (no mana spent\n  or produced).\n- `test_declining_the_may_leaves_spell_in_graveyard` — covers the optional \"you\n  may\": scripting `no` leaves the spell in the graveyard and nothing on the stack.\n- `test_resolved_free_cast_spell_is_exiled_not_in_graveyard` — covers requirement\n  2: after the free-cast spell resolves it is put into exile, and is NOT in the\n  graveyard (the replacement redirected the stack→graveyard move).\n- `test_no_op_when_graveyard_has_no_instant_or_sorcery` — edge case: with only a\n  non-instant/sorcery card in the graveyard the trigger asks for no choice (an\n  empty script would raise `ScriptExhaustedError` if it did) and casts nothing.\n\n## Edge cases deliberately NOT covered (and why)\n\n- **Legend rule / state-based actions** — handled by the engine's SBA layer"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2600,"cache_read_input_tokens":50367,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2600,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H4GY9BkXY1JQZZUdSFXSfC","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"739d4c35-fa29-430f-9073-3f7df90f56e5","request_id":"req_011CbcPdbtum3rLZ5WnFkXpP","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_1"}
