{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01JEamfuBPckSmT8A8a9AhbB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MUXKMrA92AYyc7xnCpgctW","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale — sos_4 Together as One\n\n## Summary\n`{6}` Sorcery with a converge-driven resolution: target player draws X, the\nspell deals X damage to any target, and the controller gains X life, where X is\nthe number of *distinct* colors of mana spent to cast it.\n\n## Key decisions\n- **Base class**: `Sorcery` (gives `CardType.SORCERY`, no power/toughness, not a\n  `Creature`), satisfying the static-data tests.\n- **X = distinct colors**: `x = len(set(self.colors_spent))`. The engine records\n  colors spent during payment as `colors_spent` (FDN 205 convention); duplicate\n  pips collapse via `set()`, so three red pips yield X=1. Defaults to `[]` in\n  `__init__`, so a missing/empty `colors_spent` makes X=0 and resolution a no-op\n  (covered by the robustness tests).\n- **Targeting**: two `TargetRequirement`s — a \"target player\" (filter\n  `hasattr(obj, \"life\")`) and an \"any target\" (player, creature, or\n  planeswalker). The \"any target\" filter rejects plain non-creature permanents\n  like lands. There is no `CardType.BATTLE` in `engine/types.py`, so only\n  CREATURE/PLANESWALKER (plus players) are accepted; this is sufficient for the\n  tests and matches the engine's current type model.\n- **Resolution wiring**: draw goes to `chosen_targets[0]` (the chosen player,\n  which may be the opponent), damage to `chosen_targets[1]` via\n  `engine.game.deal_damage` (handles both player life loss and creature\n  `damage_marked`), and life gain is credited to the controller (untargeted, so\n  it still applies even with no chosen targets).\n- **Defensive**: X<=0 short-circuits before touching targets; missing targets\n  are handled by length checks so resolution never raises.\n\n## Engine changes\nNone. Used existing `engine.game.deal_damage` and `engine.game.draw_card`.\n\n## Spec deviations\nNone.\n\n## Conventions for future cards\n- Converge X = `len(set(self.colors_spent))`; initialize `colors_spent = []` in\n  `__init__` for safe no-op resolution.\n- \"Any target\" filter: player (`hasattr life`) OR\n  `card_types & {CREATURE, PLANESWALKER}` (battle type not present in engine).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_read_input_tokens":49283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":204,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":71,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013PFpPuM4TrJuL5iPtrQwzQ","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"d46e9ca7-2540-458f-b70b-daddd78856fe","request_id":"req_011CbcQ9vvEqPodjxhfYJdH5","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_4"}
