{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U8dmFtWWwqKidk4hyKmbmD","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/player.py:14:    \"\"\"Raised when a DeterministicPlayer's script runs out of predetermined answers.\"\"\"\nengine/player.py:40:    def choose_target(self, options: Any, requirement: Any) -> Any:\nengine/player.py:52:    def choose(self, options: Any, description: str) -> Any:\nengine/player.py:64:    def choose_yes_no(self, prompt: str) -> bool:\nengine/player.py:86:    def choose_card(self, cards: Any, description: str) -> Any:\nengine/player.py:98:class DeterministicPlayer(Player):\nengine/player.py:127:    def choose_target(self, options: Any, requirement: Any) -> Any:\nengine/player.py:131:    def choose(self, options: Any, description: str) -> Any:\nengine/player.py:135:    def choose_yes_no(self, prompt: str) -> bool:\nengine/player.py:143:    def choose_card(self, cards: Any, description: str) -> Any:\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:13:| `player.py` | 167 | `Player` (ABC) with life/zones/mana_pool/has_lost properties and 5 abstract methods (`choose`, `choose_card`, `choose_attackers`, `choose_blockers`, `choose_order`). `DeterministicPlayer` with FIFO scripted choices. `ScriptExhaustedError`. |\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:33:- **`Player` / `DeterministicPlayer`** — Player abstraction; deterministic variant for testing."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015Z1xGT57xpDo3kx3PMFvJi","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"bc4201f5-d28b-4d91-9e52-c4fc9a9e54b5","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:45:32.213Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_13"}
