y reachable by casting the exile copy created while prepared, which is blocked by the missing preparation-card support above. There is no engine path to put the Swords-to-Plowshares copy on the stack and resolve it.\",\n    \"what_would_unblock\": \"Same preparation-card support as above, plus a constructible/castable Swords-to-Plowshares prepare-spell object whose on_resolve exiles a target creature and grants its controller life equal to its power.\"\n  }\n]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2384,"cache_read_input_tokens":71326,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2384,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":56,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015Z1xGT57xpDo3kx3PMFvJi","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"841fab46-b001-4359-a6ba-8f92cd0160b4","request_id":"req_011CbcQaptHe2vMFCF4rLePv","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_13"}
