nd add to the Keyword enum.\n- You MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything existing in engine/.\n- You MUST NOT modify any test file.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Read the spec, test file, rationale, and directives.\n2. Implement the card so ALL tests in tests.py pass, and implement the full Prepared mechanic + token color + Swords to Plowshares effect with testable contracts.\n3. Make necessary additive engine changes.\n4. Run `pytest cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` and `pytest engine_tests/` and `pytest cards/fdn/` to confirm nothing breaks.\n5. If a test is genuinely WRONG, do NOT modify it — return DISPUTE with details.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Implementation to /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py (+ engine changes).\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff — `git diff` of all changes.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md — what you did, the exact testable contracts you exposed (prepared flag, prepare-spell accessor, how to drive the cast loop, token colors), engine changes, any spec deviations.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-files.txt — modified files.\n- Upsert this card's entry into /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json (match by card: \"sos_13\"). Keep other cards' entries intact.\n\nReturn either IMPL_DONE (with files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes) or DISPUTE (with tests_failing, disputed_tests, dispute_path, notes) exactly as specified."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1618,"cache_read_input_tokens":48988,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1618},"output_tokens":59,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"ed097703-bb91-4fcc-9eed-5061a7700cfd","request_id":"req_011CbcQf4K3PPSzs4LVyoFh3"}
