{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a68dd41c586198803","tool_use_id":"toolu_01J1jkYaa4Dqr5QadoAH42K3","description":"Editing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":57107,"tool_uses":21,"duration_ms":109106},"last_tool_name":"Edit","uuid":"2df775f5-99cb-4653-a626-5eaf2b90943a","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01H89SPiQKSGdFRqCEmpkQGa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UhscW8hi4e2znQwYuhXJVJ","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","old_string":"## Edge cases intentionally NOT covered (see untestable.json)\n- The token's **color** (\"white and black\"). The engine models no first-class\n  `colors` attribute on cards/tokens, so color is not assertable.\n- The full **Prepared cast loop**: a Swords-to-Plowshares *copy* created in\n  exile that the controller \"may cast\", which \"unprepares\" the permanent. The\n  engine has no preparation-card / split-card / exile-copy-casting support, so\n  the cast-and-unprepare cycle cannot be exercised through real engine APIs.\n- The **Swords to Plowshares effect itself** (\"Exile target creature. Its\n  controller gains life equal to its power.\") — only reachable once the\n  prepare-spell copy can be cast, which is blocked by the above.","new_string":"## Follow-up coverage (round 2) — formerly-untestable requirements now exercised\n\nThe Implementer added first-class engine support (`card.colors` on cards/tokens,\n`engine.casting.cast_prepared_spell`, the `SwordsToPlowshares` effect). The\nthree previously-escalated requirements are now covered end-to-end. Total tests\ngrew from 23 to 43 (20 new), all passing.\n\n### `TestEmeritusInklingColor` — \"a 1/1 white and black Inkling\"\nResolves the ETB and inspects the created Inkling's `colors` set.\n- `test_token_is_white_and_black` — `token.colors == {WHITE, BLACK}` (the core\n  requirement; the token carries both colors, derived from its explicit token\n  color rather than a mana cost).\n- `test_token_is_white` / `test_token_is_black` — each color present\n  individually.\n- `test_token_is_not_other_colors` — blue/red/green absent (guards against an\n  over-broad color set).\n\n### `TestSwordsToPlowsharesCard` — inset prepare-spell static data\nThe prepare spell is the `{W}` instant Swords to Plowshares.\n- `test_is_instant` — `CardType.INSTANT` in `card_types`.\n- `test_name` — name is \"Swords to Plowshares\".\n- `test_mana_cost_is_w` — cost parses to `{W}`.\n- `test_is_white` — `colors == {WHITE}`.\n- `test_prepare_spell_attribute_is_swords` — `card.prepare_spell` is a\n  `SwordsToPlowshares`, and the `prepared_spell` / `other_face` aliases all\n  resolve to the same inset object.\n\n### `TestEmeritusPreparedCastLoop` — \"cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.\"\nBuilds a board where the opponent controls strictly more creatures (even after\nthe controller receives the ETB Inkling), making the Emeritus prepared, then\ndrives `engine.casting.cast_prepared_spell`.\n- `test_becomes_prepared_first` — precondition: `is_prepared` is True after ETB.\n- `test_cast_copy_clears_prepared` — casting the copy sets `is_prepared` False\n  (\"Doing so unprepares it.\").\n- `test_cast_copy_puts_spell_on_stack` — a `StackObject` is returned whose\n  `source` is a `SwordsToPlowshares`, and the stack is non-empty.\n- `test_cast_copy_is_a_distinct_object` — the cast copy is **not** the inset\n  face object itself (the face stays reusable).\n- `test_cast_when_not_prepared_is_noop` — when not prepared the helper returns\n  `None` and adds nothing to the stack (the \"may\" / unprepared guard).\n- `test_convenience_method_delegates` — `card.cast_prepare_copy(...)` behaves\n  identically to the engine helper.\n\n### `TestSwordsToPlowsharesEffect` — \"Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.\"\nPrepares the Emeritus, casts the copy targeting an opponent creature, and\nresolves the stack object.\n- `test_target_creature_is_exiled` — target leaves the battlefield and lands in\n  exile on resolution.\n- `test_controller_gains_life_equal_to_power` — the target's controller (p2)\n  gains life equal to the target's power (4).\n- `test_life_gain_uses_targets_controller_not_caster` — the life goes to the\n  creature's controller, not the spell's caster (p1's life is unchanged).\n- `test_zero_power_creature_grants_no_life` — a 0-power target is still exiled\n  but grants no life (boundary of \"equal to its power\").\n- `test_effect_directly_on_resolve` — drives `SwordsToPlowshares.on_resolve`\n  directly with a chosen target, independent of the prepared-cast plumbing, to\n  pin the exile + life-gain behavior in isolation.\n\n## Edge cases intentionally NOT covered\n- The \"may\" optionality of the cast (a player declining to cast the prepared\n  copy) — the engine helper models the act of casting, not the decision UI, so\n  declining is simply \"don't call the helper\"; nothing card-specific to assert."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_read_input_tokens":56458,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":322,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J1jkYaa4Dqr5QadoAH42K3","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"7135f690-d729-45d1-91bc-9a1f9601b483","request_id":"req_011CbcRAdLCzw2fJcvP6u2ys","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_13"}
