ure's power.\n\nRead the implementation/engine source to use the REAL APIs. Follow existing test conventions and DeterministicPlayer. Do NOT modify or break existing tests.\n\nAfter writing, run `pytest cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` and confirm ALL tests pass.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Update /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py with new tests.\n- Append new coverage to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md.\n- Empty /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json to [] (or note any genuinely-remaining items).\n\nReturn a short status: total tests now, how many new, all passing (yes/no), remaining untestable_count.","agentId":"a68dd41c586198803","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three previously-untestable requirements are now covered end-to-end and passing.\n\nTESTS_REWRITTEN\n- test_files: 1 (`/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py`)\n- total tests now: 43 (was 23)\n- new tests: 20\n- all passing: yes (43 passed)\n- remaining untestable_count: 0 (`/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json` emptied to `[]`)\n\nCoverage added across four new classes:\n- `TestEmeritusInklingColor` (4) — asserts `token.colors == {Color.WHITE, Color.BLACK}` plus per-color and negative-color checks.\n- `TestSwordsToPlowsharesCard` (5) — inset prepare-spell static data ({W} white instant, alias resolution).\n- `TestEmeritusPreparedCastLoop` (6) — become prepared → `cast_prepared_spell` clears `is_prepared`, returns a `StackObject` whose source is a distinct `SwordsToPlowshares` copy; no-op when not prepared; convenience method delegates.\n- `TestSwordsToPlowsharesEffect` (5) — target exiled, its controller gains life equal to its power, life goes to the creature's controller (not the caster), 0-power boundary, and a direct `on_resolve` check.\n\nI did not modify or remove any of the 23 existing tests; one existing fixture comment was left intact. No files under `engine_tests/` or `cards/fdn/` were touched.\n\nRationale appended at `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale