{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DF3kwhRiySSAUTZrGgCsYf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent, cross-run conventions and decisions.\n4\t\n5\t\n6\t## Engine: spell resolution → graveyard is a replaceable move (sos_1)\n7\t`engine/casting._resolve_spell` now routes a resolving non-permanent spell's\n8\tstack→graveyard move through the replacement manager via the additive\n9\t`SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (subclass of `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent`,\n10\tin `engine/events.py`). Cards needing \"if this spell would go to the graveyard,\n11\texile/do X instead\" should register a `ReplacementEffect` keyed to the spell that\n12\tmatches `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` and rewrites `destination`. Default\n13\tbehavior (no matching replacement → graveyard) is unchanged.\n14\t\n15\t## Convention: converge (sos_4)\n16\tConverge X = number of distinct colors of mana spent to cast = `len(set(self.colors_spent))`.\n17\tThe engine records `colors_spent` during payment (FDN 205 convention). Initialize\n18\t`self.colors_spent = []` in `__init__` so an unpaid/empty cast yields X=0 and a\n19\tsafe no-op resolution. \"Any target\" filter: a player (`hasattr(obj,\"life\")`) OR a\n20\tpermanent whose `card_types` intersects {CREATURE, PLANESWALKER} (engine/types.py\n21\thas no BATTLE type).\n22\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016sHYHrLzMEu8tVidtZV53L","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"0c749a72-5281-4704-b996-a95928bfcd5e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:56:08.477Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_13 implementation"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017MwKGKHVyChbdWaYRkUcvd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"cards\": [\n3\t    {\n4\t      \"card\": \"sos_1\",\n5\t      \"tests\": [\n6\t        {\n7\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\",\n8\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_1 The Dawning Archaic: card data, graveyard-count cost reduction, and attack trigger registration/firing\"\n9\t        }\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"implementation\": [\n12\t        {\n13\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py\",\n14\t          \"summary\": \"The Dawning Archaic: cost reduction, attack trigger free-casting a graveyard instant/sorcery and registering its exile-instead replacement\"\n15\t        },\n16\t        {\n17\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n18\t          \"summary\": \"added SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent for spell stack->graveyard redirection\"\n19\t        },\n20\t        {\n21\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n22\t          \"summary\": \"_resolve_spell consults replacement effects so a resolving spell can be exiled instead of going to the graveyard\"\n23\t        }\n24\t      ]\n25\t    },\n26\t    {\n27\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n28\t      \"tests\": [\n29\t        {\n30\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n31\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce: static data, Prepared surface, self-only ETB trigger, 1/1 flying Inkling token creation, and strict opponent-creature-count prepared conditional\"\n32\t        }\n33\t      ],\n34\t      \"implementation\": [\n35\t        {\n36\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n37\t          \"summary\": \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares: ETB white+black flying Inkling token for target player, conditional is_prepared, prepare_spell face, and Swords to Plowshares exile+lifegain effect\"\n38\t        },\n39\t        {\n40\t          \"path\": \"engine/card.py\",\n41\t          \"summary\": \"added additive colors set attribute on CardImpl/Creature (explicit for tokens, else derived from mana cost) for observable token color\"\n42\t        },\n43\t        {\n44\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n45\t          \"summary\": \"added cast_prepared_spell helper that casts a free copy of a prepared permanent's prepare spell from exile and clears the prepared flag\"\n46\t        },\n47\t        {\n48\t          \"path\": \"engine/protection.py\",\n49\t          \"summary\": \"get_colors treats a present-but-empty colors set as no color info so mana-cost / singular color fallbacks still apply\"\n50\t        }\n51\t      ]\n52\t    },\n53\t    {\n54\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n55\t      \"tests\": [\n56\t        {\n57\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n58\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_4 Together as One: sorcery card data, target-player + any-target requirements, and converge X-driven draw/damage/lifegain incl. zero/five-color edges\"\n59\t        }\n60\t      ],\n61\t      \"implementation\": [\n62\t        {\n63\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n64\t          \"summary\": \"Together as One: converge sorcery; X=distinct colors_spent drives target-player draw, any-target damage, and controller life gain\"\n65\t        }\n66\t      ]\n67\t    }\n68\t  ]\n69\t}\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016sHYHrLzMEu8tVidtZV53L","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"27b9d530-98b7-44c4-ad26-1b05dd9933e8","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:56:08.477Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_13 implementation"}
