{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WA89SBConMcNVCzWV6GHno","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/events.py:29:class EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\nengine/events.py:30:    permanent: Any = None\nengine/events.py:38:    permanent: Any = None\nengine/events.py:117:    permanent: Any = None\nengine/events.py:133:    \"\"\"Any permanent moving to a graveyard.\nengine/events.py:139:    permanent to a different zone (``\"exile\"``, ``\"library\"``, ``\"hand\"``).\nengine/events.py:168:    \"\"\"A non-creature permanent going to the graveyard via destruction.\"\"\"\nengine/events.py:170:    permanent: Any = None\nengine/events.py:174:        return self.permanent\nengine/events.py:179:    \"\"\"A permanent going to the graveyard via sacrifice.\"\"\"\nengine/events.py:181:    permanent: Any = None\nengine/events.py:185:        return self.permanent\nengine/events.py:193:    before a non-permanent spell is put into its owner's graveyard, so that\nengine/events.py:217:    \"\"\"An effect about to add one or more counters to a permanent.\"\"\"\nengine/events.py:219:    permanent: Any = None\nengine/triggers.py:27:class TriggerRegistration:\nengine/triggers.py:39:        source: The game object (card / permanent) that owns this trigger.\nengine/triggers.py:54:    Triggers are registered when a permanent enters the battlefield (or","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016sHYHrLzMEu8tVidtZV53L","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"1a6a6188-abf8-4493-9bde-4850f6bfbed5","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:56:48.576Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_13 implementation"}
