{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012zch6kEsDPBzQ7ZtM11qPP","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/abilities.py:14:  loyalty abilities with per-turn restriction and loyalty-counter cost.\nengine/abilities.py:75:    The cost adjusts the loyalty counters on the source planeswalker.\nengine/abilities.py:171:       abilities, adjust loyalty counters and enforce once-per-turn.\nengine/game.py:9:  ``discard``, ``create_token``, ``add_counter``, ``remove_counter``,\nengine/game.py:387:def add_counter(\nengine/game.py:390:    counter_type: str,\nengine/game.py:393:    \"\"\"Add *amount* counters of *counter_type* to *permanent*.\nengine/game.py:395:    Supports ``\"+1/+1\"`` and ``\"-1/-1\"`` counter types via the\nengine/game.py:396:    ``plus_one_counters`` / ``minus_one_counters`` attributes.  For other\nengine/game.py:397:    counter types, uses a generic ``counters`` dict.\nengine/game.py:401:        permanent: The permanent to add counters to.\nengine/game.py:402:        counter_type: The type of counter (e.g. ``\"+1/+1\"``, ``\"-1/-1\"``,\nengine/game.py:404:        amount: Number of counters to add (default 1).\nengine/game.py:409:    if counter_type == \"+1/+1\" and hasattr(permanent, \"plus_one_counters\"):\nengine/game.py:410:        permanent.plus_one_counters += amount\nengine/game.py:411:    elif counter_type == \"-1/-1\" and hasattr(permanent, \"minus_one_counters\"):\nengine/game.py:412:        permanent.minus_one_counters += amount\nengine/game.py:413:    elif counter_type == \"loyalty\" and hasattr(permanent, \"loyalty\"):\nengine/game.py:416:        # Generic counter storage\nengine/game.py:417:        if not hasattr(permanent, \"counters\"):\nengine/game.py:418:            permanent.counters = {}\nengine/game.py:419:        permanent.counters[counter_type] = permanent.counters.get(counter_type, 0) + amount\nengine/game.py:422:def remove_counter(\nengine/game.py:425:    counter_type: str,\nengine/game.py:428:    \"\"\"Remove *amount* counters of *counter_type* from *permanent*.\nengine/game.py:434:        permanent: The permanent to remove counters from.\nengine/game.py:435:        counter_type: The type of counter to remove.\nengine/game.py:436:        amount: Number of counters to remove (default 1).\nengine/game.py:441:    if counter_type == \"+1/+1\" and hasattr(permanent, \"plus_one_counters\"):\nengine/game.py:442:        permanent.plus_one_counters = max(0, permanent.plus_one_counters - amount)\nengine/game.py:443:    elif counter_type == \"-1/-1\" and hasattr(permanent, \"minus_one_counters\"):\nengine/game.py:444:        permanent.minus_one_counters = max(0, permanent.minus_one_counters - amount)\nengine/game.py:445:    elif counter_type == \"loyalty\" and hasattr(permanent, \"loyalty\"):\nengine/game.py:448:        if hasattr(permanent, \"counters\") and counter_type in permanent.counters:\nengine/game.py:449:            permanent.counters[counter_type] = max(\nengine/game.py:450:                0, permanent.counters[counter_type] - amount\nengine/casting.py:278:    stack and can be responded to normally (e.g. countered).\nengine/state_based_actions.py:272:def _sba_counter_annihilation(game: GameState) -> bool:\nengine/state_based_actions.py:273:    \"\"\"+1/+1 and -1/-1 counters on the same permanent annihilate in pairs.\"\"\"\nengine/state_based_actions.py:278:                hasattr(obj, \"plus_one_counters\")\nengine/state_based_actions.py:279:                and hasattr(obj, \"minus_one_counters\")\nengine/state_based_actions.py:281:                plus = obj.plus_one_counters\nengine/state_based_actions.py:282:                minus = obj.minus_one_counters\nengine/state_based_actions.py:285:                    obj.plus_one_counters -= annihilate\nengine/state_based_actions.py:286:                    obj.minus_one_counters -= annihilate\nengine/state_based_actions.py:317:    # +1/+1 and -1/-1 counter annihilation\nengine/state_based_actions.py:318:    action_taken = _sba_counter_annihilation(game) or action_taken\nengine/continuous_effects.py:9:    modifications), and 7d (P/T from counters) are fully functional.\nengine/continuous_effects.py:46:      - 7d: P/T changes from counters.\nengine/card.py:141:    auto-incrementing counter.\nengine/card.py:158:    def reset_id_counter(cls) -> None:\nengine/card.py:159:        \"\"\"Reset the auto-incrementing counter (useful in tests).\"\"\"\nengine/card.py:293:        modified_power: Current power after continuous effects (Layer 7c), before counters.\nengine/card.py:295:        modified_toughness: Current toughness after continuous effects, before counters.\nengine/card.py:301:        plus_one_counters: Number of +1/+1 counters.\nengine/card.py:302:        minus_one_counters: Number of -1/-1 counters.\nengine/card.py:344:        self.plus_one_counters: int = 0\nengine/card.py:345:        self.minus_one_counters: int = 0\nengine/card.py:348:        self._base_plus_one_counters: int = 0\nengine/card.py:349:        self._base_minus_one_counters: int = 0\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 60]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015SHGWHNJVkcYKhc7mafbPZ","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"0d5e7a2c-bbbc-4d92-a34e-9c78c1468d76","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:58:40.689Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_57"}
