{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MaJx9dhyj2q7GBueMZ7nkp","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/events.py:24:class TriggeredEvent:\nengine/game.py:381:    if hasattr(token, \"register_triggers\"):\nengine/game.py:382:        token.register_triggers(game)\nengine/casting.py:507:    # ENTERS_BATTLEFIELD and registers triggers/replacement effects.\nengine/zones.py:205:       c. Unregister triggers and replacement effects (fires happen\nengine/zones.py:206:          **before** unregister so self-referencing triggers still match).\nengine/zones.py:208:       a. Register triggers (``register_triggers``) and replacement\nengine/zones.py:297:        # Now unregister triggers and replacement effects.\nengine/zones.py:314:        if hasattr(card, \"register_triggers\"):\nengine/zones.py:315:            card.register_triggers(game)\nengine/triggers.py:3:Provides the core mechanism for registering triggered abilities and firing\nengine/triggers.py:27:class TriggerRegistration:\nengine/triggers.py:51:class TriggerManager:\nengine/triggers.py:57:    :meth:`fire_event` checks all registered triggers of a matching\nengine/triggers.py:73:    def register(self, trigger: TriggerRegistration) -> None:\nengine/triggers.py:127:        \"\"\"Return a shallow copy of all registered triggers.\"\"\"\nengine/triggers.py:135:        \"\"\"Remove all registered triggers.\"\"\"\nengine/card.py:265:    def register_triggers(self, game: GameState) -> None:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015SHGWHNJVkcYKhc7mafbPZ","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"0019db7a-a71c-48dc-af03-a18268c6916e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T10:59:10.048Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_57"}
