{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_014a4TZXLKxAiRe7qzxHyQGY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QHCMSqJrbRr9bCZWwCwmma","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test rationale — sos_57 Mana Sculpt\n\nCard: **Mana Sculpt** — `{1}{U}{U}` Instant (blue).\nOracle: *\"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C}\nequal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your\nnext main phase.\"*\n\nTest file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` (20 tests).\n\n## Engine surface findings\n\n- The engine ships **no built-in counter mechanism**, **no per-spell mana-spent\n  tracking** (`ManaPool` only exposes `last_payment_colors`), and **no\n  beginning-of-main-phase trigger event** (`advance_phase()` fires nothing;\n  only `BeginningOfUpkeep` is fired in `turn.py`). The implementation must\n  provide the counter and the delayed conditional mana itself.\n- Tests therefore drive the observable contract: stack/zone movement for the\n  counter, and the presence/absence + colorless amount of a delayed effect\n  (a registered trigger) keyed on Wizard control. The precise \"mana spent vs\n  mana value\" and \"fires at next main phase via natural progression\" pieces are\n  recorded in `untestable.json`.\n\n## Test cases\n\n### TestManaSculptProperties — static card data\n- `test_name` — name is \"Mana Sculpt\".\n- `test_is_instant` — subclass of `Instant`, `INSTANT` in `card_types`.\n- `test_mana_cost` — cost equals `{1}{U}{U}`.\n- `test_is_blue` — `Color.BLUE` in `card.colors` (per KEY_DECISIONS colors attr).\n- `test_not_a_creature` — `CREATURE` not in card_types. (Benign guardrail;\n  passes against the stub but pins a real contract.)\n\n### TestManaSculptTargeting — \"Counter target spell\"\n- `test_returns_one_target_requirement` — `get_targets` returns exactly one\n  `TargetRequirement`.\n- `test_target_requirement_uses_stack_zone` — the requirement's `zone` is\n  `Zone.STACK` (spells live on the stack).\n- `test_filter_accepts_an_instant_spell` / `test_filter_accepts_a_sorcery_spell`\n  — the target filter accepts instant and sorcery spells.\n- `test_filter_rejects_a_player` — \"target spell\" is not \"any target\"; players\n  are illegal targets.\n\n### TestManaSculptCounter — counter resolution\n- `test_targeted_spell_leaves_the_stack` — after `on_resolve`, the victim's\n  StackObject is gone and its card has left the caster's STACK zone.\n- `test_countered_spell_goes_to_owners_graveyard` — the countered spell is put\n  into its **owner's** graveyard (the victim's owner, not Mana Sculpt's).\n- `test_countered_spell_does_not_resolve` — the victim's StackObject is removed\n  (so its resolve callback can never fire) and it never reached the\n  battlefield.\n- `test_no_target_resolution_is_safe_noop` — with no chosen target, resolution\n  does not raise and leaves the stack untouched. (Defensive; passes against the\n  stub but guards against crashes once implemented.)\n\n### TestManaSculptWizardConditional — \"If you control a Wizard\"\n- `test_no_wizard_sets_up_no_delayed_mana_effect` — controlling only a\n  non-Wizard creature: resolution registers **no** new trigger, but the counter\n  still happens.\n- `test_wizard_control_sets_up_a_delayed_mana_effect` — controlling a Wizard:\n  resolution registers exactly one new trigger (the delayed mana payoff).\n- `test_delayed_effect_controlled_by_mana_sculpt_caster` — the delayed effect is\n  controlled by Mana Sculpt's controller (the player who gets the {C}).\n\n### TestManaSculptManaPayoff — colorless mana amount\nDrive the delayed effect by running its registered trigger effect directly and\nobserve the controller's mana pool:\n- `test_payoff_adds_colorless_equal_to_mana_spent` — countering a 3-mana spell\n  adds 3 `{C}`.\n- `test_payoff_amount_scales_with_spell_cost` — countering a 1-mana spell adds\n  only 1 `{C}`.\n- `test_payoff_mana_is_colorless_not_colored` — the added mana is `{C}` only; no\n  colored mana is produced.\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- No-Wizard vs Wizard branch (the static conditional).\n- Owner's (not caster's) graveyard destination for the countered spell.\n- Colorless-only payoff; amount scales with the countered spell's cost.\n- No-target safety (no crash, no stack mutation).\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (see untestable.json)\n- **Actual mana spent ≠ mana value** (X spells, additional costs, cost\n  reduction): the engine does not track per-spell mana spent, so amount tests\n  use fixed-cost spells where spent == CMC.\n- **Natural firing at \"next main phase\"**: no begin-of-main-phase trigger event\n  exists in the engine, so the payoff is exercised via the trigger's effect\n  callback rather than through phase progression.\n\n## Out of scope\n- The opponent's ability to respond to Mana Sculpt itself, full priority loops,\n  and split second / can't-be-countered interactions — not implied by this\n  card's text and not part of its local contract.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":717,"cache_read_input_tokens":83933,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":717,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":65,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015SHGWHNJVkcYKhc7mafbPZ","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"a87dad04-acc2-4c3e-931d-040f312dad8b","request_id":"req_011CbcRfrzYiEv1rZCZ4cV1H","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_57"}
