{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01KLHaKGs2WfZjKpq6wp1qcu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NPQJoCNV87Zr5zMfmEZK6M","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/coordinator-directives.md","content":"# Coordinator Directives — sos_57 (initial implementation)\n\nCard: **Mana Sculpt** — `{1}{U}{U}` Instant. \"Counter target spell. If you\ncontrol a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast\nthat spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n\nThe Tester escalated two requirements as untestable due to missing engine\nsupport. Engine changes are allowed and expected. Implement the FULL card and add\nthe engine support so both become testable.\n\n## Requirements to implement fully\n1. **Counter target spell** — target a spell on the stack and counter it (move to\n   owner's graveyard). Use existing counter machinery if present.\n2. **Wizard conditional** — only set up the mana payoff if the controller\n   controls a Wizard at resolution.\n3. **Mana spent payoff** — \"add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent\n   to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n\n## Engine support to add (additive only — no renames/moves/deletes)\n1. **Track total mana spent per cast.** Record the TOTAL quantity of mana paid to\n   cast a spell (not just distinct colors) onto the card/StackObject during the\n   cast (e.g. `ManaPool.last_payment_total` persisted as `spell.mana_spent` or\n   similar). This must reflect actual mana paid (so X spells / cost-reduced spells\n   diverge from printed mana value). Expose it as a queryable attribute so the\n   countered spell's mana-spent figure can be read at resolution and asserted by\n   tests.\n2. **Beginning-of-main-phase trigger.** Add a `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`\n   (mirror the existing `BeginningOfUpkeep` event/firing pattern) and fire it at\n   the start of the controller's main phase during the turn loop /\n   `advance_phase()`. This is the firing site for the delayed {C} mana. Be careful\n   not to break existing engine tests — match the existing event/trigger\n   conventions and only ADD a firing site.\n\n## Make it testable\n- Implement the delayed effect as a registered trigger keyed to\n  `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` for the controller, adding {C} mana = the\n  recorded mana spent on the countered spell.\n- Expose enough surface that a test can: counter a spell (incl. an X / cost-\n  reduced spell to prove it's actual mana spent, not CMC), advance to the\n  controller's next main phase, and assert the correct {C} appears in the pool.\n- Document the exact contracts (attribute names, event name) in your rationale.\n\nDo NOT stub these out — the grader's authoritative tests will exercise the full\nmana-spent tracking and the begin-of-main-phase delayed payoff.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1041,"cache_read_input_tokens":60535,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1041},"output_tokens":46,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"b3869eeb-1543-45a2-a08e-c388f037da7e","request_id":"req_011CbcRi9eTqmRVvptw6JHSX"}
