e the turn loop to the controller's next main phase, and assert {C} equal to the mana spent appears in the controller's mana pool via the natural trigger firing path. Also confirm NO payoff when no Wizard is controlled.\n\nRead the implementation/engine source to use REAL APIs. Follow existing test conventions and DeterministicPlayer. Do NOT modify or break existing tests.\n\nAfter writing, run `pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` and confirm ALL tests pass.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Update /workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py with new tests.\n- Append new coverage to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md.\n- Empty /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/untestable.json to [] (or note any genuinely-remaining items).\n\nReturn a short status: total tests now, how many new, all passing (yes/no), remaining untestable_count.","uuid":"c1b4499a-09f6-4dd5-b722-44c568519b23","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445"}
