{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0144yyhQJidrLDrPv1Gwwc7v","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"test-files.txt already lists the single file (unchanged). All done.\n\n## Status\n\n- **Total tests now:** 27 (in `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`)\n- **New tests:** 7 (20 → 27), across two new classes:\n  - `TestManaSpentTrackingPipeline` (2 tests) — casts a cost-reduced `{4}`-spell-for-`{2}` through the real `engine.casting.cast_spell` pipeline and asserts `spell.mana_spent == 2` while `cmc == 4`; then counters it with Mana Sculpt and confirms the delayed `{C}` equals actual mana spent (2), not CMC (4).\n  - `TestManaSculptNaturalPayoff` (5 tests) — drives the payoff through the real `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` firing path: fires at the controller's main phase (+3 {C}), does NOT fire on the opponent's main phase, is one-shot (unregisters), produces no payoff with no Wizard, and an end-to-end `engine.turn.run_turn` test (both players scripted to pass) where the engine itself fires the event and a spy on the controller's `mana_pool.add` captures the 3 {C} granted.\n- **All passing:** yes (27 passed)\n- **Remaining untestable_count:** 0 — `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/untestable.json` is now `[]`.\n\nNotes: existing 20 tests were left unchanged and still pass. The mana-spent divergence uses a cost-reduced spell (engine treats X as 0 in `can_pay`/`pay`, so a cost-reduction path is the reliable way to make `mana_spent != cmc`). The natural-firing tests fire the real `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` through `trigger_manager.fire_event` (the same call `run_turn` makes) and resolve the resulting stack object, plus one true full-`run_turn` test. Rationale appended at `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md`."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aab8766029b96ec3d (use SendMessage with to: 'aab8766029b96ec3d' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 76485\ntool_uses: 33\nduration_ms: 173093</usage