{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TkhGjWVMBBCkoWoM2iqcE5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014usC74hWkSncGEoU4EzP3w","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Engine: mana-spent tracking + beginning-of-main-phase trigger (sos_57)\n- `ManaPool.last_payment_total` (read-only property) records the TOTAL quantity of\n  mana paid on the last payment (alongside the existing `last_payment_colors`).\n  `engine.casting.cast_spell` persists it onto the spell as `card.mana_spent`\n  (diverges from CMC for X / cost-reduced spells). Cards reading mana spent should\n  use `spell.mana_spent`, falling back to `mana_cost.cmc` for stack-placed spells.\n- `engine.events.BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` (fields: `player`, `phase`) is\n  fired in `engine.turn.run_turn` at the start of each main phase\n  (PRECOMBAT_MAIN / POSTCOMBAT_MAIN when `game.step is None`), mirroring the\n  BeginningOfUpkeep firing pattern. Use it for begin-of-main-phase delayed effects;\n  scope the trigger condition to `event.player is controller` and make one-shot\n  delayed effects unregister themselves after firing.\nEOF\ngit add cards/sos/sos_57/ engine/mana.py engine/casting.py engine/events.py engine/turn.py FILES_MODIFIED.json KEY_DECISIONS.md RUN_DECISIONS.md && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat: implement card sos_57\n\nMana Sculpt: counter target spell and, if a Wizard is controlled, add {C}\nequal to mana spent to cast it at the beginning of your next main phase.\nAdds additive engine support: ManaPool.last_payment_total / card.mana_spent\nand a BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent fired in the turn loop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Log conventions and commit sos_57"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_token