GREE with the strict comment, do NOT silently skip it — record your reasoning in disagreements.json.\n\nENGINE RULES: additive only — may modify function BODIES (e.g. advance_phase body), may add helpers; MUST NOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols; MUST NOT break engine_tests/ pinned counts; MUST NOT modify test files.\n\nVERIFY: run `pytest cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py`, `pytest engine_tests/`, and `pytest cards/fdn/` — all must pass.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Updated /workspace/cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py and engine changes.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-revised.diff — `git diff` of ALL current changes (cumulative).\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-revised-rationale.md — what you changed and how the turn-skip now executes; confirm tests pass.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/disagreements.json — JSON array of {review_comment_index, reviewer_comment, implementer_justification}. Empty array [] if you applied everything.\n- Update this card's entry in /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json if the set of modified files changed.\n\nReturn:\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: <N>\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/disagreements.json"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":923,"cache_read_input_tokens":82061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":923},"output_tokens":47,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"f298e21b-d683-4f94-966f-8ae919d292ee","request_id":"req_011CbcT2ykoMnmzvSkDVFL4P"}
