{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S9ZMgsvG4xq4NSWkmv2KvS","type":"tool_result","content":"75\tclass BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n76\t    \"\"\"Fired at the start of each main phase (precombat and postcombat).\n77\t\n78\t    Mirrors :class:`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`.  ``player`` is the\n79\t    active player whose main phase is beginning, and ``phase`` is the\n80\t    :class:`~engine.types.Phase` value (``PRECOMBAT_MAIN`` / ``POSTCOMBAT_MAIN``)\n81\t    so triggers can distinguish the two main phases when needed.\n82\t    \"\"\"\n83\t\n84\t    player: Any = None\n85\t    phase: Any = None\n86\t\n87\t\n88\t@dataclass\n89\tclass BeginningOfCombatTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n90\t    pass\n91\t\n92\t\n93\t@dataclass\n94\tclass EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n95\t    pass\n96\t\n97\t\n98\t@dataclass\n99\tclass EndStepTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n100\t    player: Any = None\n101\t\n102\t\n103\t@dataclass\n104\tclass CreatureDiesTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012rXFMpMiUxgBU3maGZJedn","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"ae6892dd-6dd8-4bb3-b7b8-a25e7ded47ce","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:24:04.270Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_120"}
