y\" patterns.\n- RULEBOOK.txt (grep, don't read whole) for Lesson, mana value, \"cast without paying its mana cost\".\n\nENGINE RULES (from AGENTS.md):\n- Additive only: may add methods/classes/helpers/files, modify existing function bodies; MUST NOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols; MUST NOT break engine_tests pinned counts (e.g. Keyword=16); MUST NOT modify test files.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Read the spec, test file, rationale.\n2. Implement the card so ALL tests in tests.py pass, reusing the conventions above. Add additive engine support only if truly needed.\n3. Run `pytest cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py`, `pytest engine_tests/`, `pytest cards/fdn/` to confirm nothing breaks.\n4. If a test is genuinely WRONG, do NOT modify it — return DISPUTE with details.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Implementation to /workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py (+ any engine changes).\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl.diff — `git diff` of all changes.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md — what you did, conventions reused, any engine changes, any spec deviations.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-files.txt — modified files.\n- Upsert this card's entry into /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json (match by card: \"sos_120\"). Keep other entries intact.\n\nReturn either IMPL_DONE (files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes) or DISPUTE (tests_failing, disputed_tests, dispute_path, notes) exactly as specified."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FtrFyqD3oNPonppRCGoUAu","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"e40871a9-f7c9-4978-b071-a5afcca549ad","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:26:49.506Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120"}
