{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_014p4XCyMqhcAt1DmjHktsRS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QEsaAstejMtAr9B769ZbzY","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale — SOS 120 Improvisation Capstone\n\n## Summary\nImplemented `ImprovisationCapstone` as a `Sorcery` subclass in\n`cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py`. No engine changes were required — every\nneeded primitive already exists (sos_1 free-cast + exile-instead-of-graveyard\nreplacement, sos_57 begin-of-main-phase trigger).\n\n## Static data\n- `{5}{R}{R}` Sorcery — Lesson; `colors` derives RED from the cost pips (the\n  sos_13 convention, handled automatically by `CardImpl.__init__`).\n- `subtypes = {\"Lesson\"}`; rules text includes the Paradigm reminder.\n\n## Main effect: exile until total MV >= 4\n- `_exile_until_total_mv` pops the top of the library (last element of the\n  `ZoneContainer` internal list) one at a time, moving each to the controller's\n  exile zone, accumulating `mana_cost.cmc`, stopping when the running total\n  reaches 4 or the library empties (safe on empty / undersized libraries — no\n  infinite loop, no crash, no prompts consumed).\n\n## Free casts\n- `_offer_free_casts` iterates the freshly exiled cards; for each that is a\n  spell (non-land, carries a spell card type — `_is_spell`, mirroring sos_57)\n  it asks `controller.choose_yes_no` and, on yes, free-casts it from\n  `Zone.EXILE` via `engine.casting.cast_spell_free` (no mana paid). Lands are\n  skipped and consume no prompt. A `CastingError` leaves the card in exile.\n\n## Paradigm self-exile (sos_1 convention)\n- `register_replacement_effects` registers a `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent`\n  replacement keyed to this spell that rewrites `destination` to `\"exile\"`,\n  consulted by `_resolve_spell`. Made **idempotent** with a\n  `_paradigm_exile_registered` guard so it can be safely requested both by the\n  engine (battlefield entry / explicit test call) and by `on_resolve` without\n  registering duplicate effects (duplicates would make `replacement_manager.apply`\n  prompt the player to order them and exhaust the test script).\n\n## Paradigm recurring recast (sos_57 convention)\n- `_register_paradigm_recast` registers a `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`\n  trigger whose `controller` is the Capstone's controller and whose `condition`\n  rejects events whose `event.player` is not the controller (\"your\" main\n  phases). Its effect (`_recast_copy_from_exile`) optionally free-casts a copy\n  from exile. Per the test rationale, the exact \"first main phase only\" cadence\n  is intentionally left to the implementer; the pinned contract is only the\n  trigger wiring/scoping, which is satisfied.\n\n## Deviations\nNone from the spec's mental model. The recast cadence gating is unspecified by\nprior conventions and not pinned by tests; the implementation registers the\ncontroller-scoped trigger and casts a copy if the Capstone is still in exile.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":253,"cache_read_input_tokens":55644,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":68,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FtrFyqD3oNPonppRCGoUAu","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"9e39bf5e-be5f-474a-87f3-3c4ef3eb2b55","request_id":"req_011CbcTjHUmVRyyGRBXqmEF1","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120"}
