{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FSRqL4E8yEghPejPEWAn9Y","type":"tool_result","content":"260:def cast_spell_free(\n261-    game: GameState,\n262-    player: Player,\n263-    card: CardImpl,\n264-    from_zone: Zone,\n265-) -> None:\n266-    \"\"\"Cast *card* without paying its mana cost, using the stack.\n267-\n268-    This is used by effects that allow casting from zones other than hand\n269-    (e.g. exile) without paying mana costs — such as Etali, Primal Storm\n270-    or cascade.\n271-\n272-    Pipeline\n273-    --------\n274-    1. **can_cast** — ask the card whether it can legally be cast (same\n275-       legality as :func:`cast_spell`, minus mana/timing constraints).\n276-    2. Move *card* from *from_zone* to the stack zone.\n277-    3. Choose targets (if applicable) with validation and protection check.\n278-    4. Call ``on_cast`` hook.\n279-    5. Push a :class:`StackObject` whose ``on_resolve`` callback handles\n280-       resolution normally (permanents → battlefield, non-permanents →"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0194AK5hQNxBUeswbmqVEoQM","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"53343a51-7785-44d0-9d70-d77b11a39065","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:29:52.363Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_120 implementation"}
