{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_0147WJ2MeKJt2GK5D5WUX8nP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014bBgPmutu2YB4oTUNH8Yhs","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","old_string":"The deeper requirement — actually casting a drawn card for its {2} miracle cost\nonly when it's the first card drawn this turn — is recorded in `untestable.json`\nbecause the engine has no miracle/draw-step surface to exercise it.","new_string":"The deeper requirement — actually casting a drawn card for its {2} miracle cost\nonly when it's the first card drawn this turn — is now covered by\n`TestLoreholdMiracleDrawCast` (below) using the engine miracle surface the\nImplementer added.\n\n### TestLoreholdMiracleDrawCast (draw-time miracle cast — end-to-end)\nStamps a card with Lorehold's miracle cost, places it on top of the controller's\nlibrary, and draws it via `engine.game.draw_card`, exercising the real\n`offer_miracle` → `cast_spell_alternative` path:\n- `test_first_draw_yes_casts_for_miracle_cost` — first card drawn + scripted\n  \"yes\" + {2} available ⇒ the spell goes on the stack and leaves the hand.\n- `test_first_draw_yes_pays_two_not_full_cost` — a {2}{U} sorcery cast with only\n  {2} in the pool proves the *alternative* ({2}) cost is paid, not the full cost;\n  the pool is empty afterward.\n- `test_first_draw_no_leaves_card_in_hand` — declining the \"you may\" leaves the\n  card in hand, nothing on the stack, no mana spent.\n- `test_not_first_draw_does_not_offer_miracle` — first-card gating: with\n  `cards_drawn_this_turn` pre-set so this is the second draw, no miracle is\n  offered (empty yes/no script would raise loudly if the hook wrongly fired);\n  card stays in hand, no mana spent.\n- `test_first_draw_yes_without_mana_keeps_card_in_hand` — \"yes\" but an empty mana\n  pool ⇒ the cast fails gracefully, card stays in hand, stack empty.\n- `test_stamp_is_readable_via_engine_helper` — the {2} stamp Lorehold sets on a\n  hand card is what `engine.miracle.get_miracle_cost` reads (shared contract)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":454,"cache_read_input_tokens":57033,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":454,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":61,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019Mbmw3oikAhHtz8Xfv7wgN","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"16f259f3-2c3e-4d2d-97af-5868b80c4dc3","request_id":"req_011CbcUgTQM8CzxEQRKRAzqp","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_201"}
