nd (normal draw, no cast).\n3. First-card gating: when the card is NOT the first card drawn this turn, the miracle cast is NOT offered/cannot happen.\n\nRead the implementation/engine source to use the REAL APIs (draw_card, set_miracle_cost, etc.) and DeterministicPlayer. Follow existing test conventions. Do NOT modify or break existing tests.\n\nAfter writing, run `pytest cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` and confirm ALL tests pass.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Update /workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py with new tests.\n- Append new coverage to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md.\n- Empty /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/untestable.json to [] (or note any genuinely-remaining items).\n\nReturn a short status: total tests now, how many new, all passing (yes/no), remaining untestable_count.","agentId":"ae2decd02be5c429a","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TESTS_WRITTEN\n\n- total tests now: 31 (was 25)\n- new tests: 6 (all in a new `TestLoreholdMiracleDrawCast` class)\n- all passing: yes (31 passed)\n- remaining untestable_count: 0\n\nSummary of new coverage (the previously-untestable miracle requirement, now exercised end-to-end through `engine.game.draw_card` → `offer_miracle` → `cast_spell_alternative`):\n- `test_first_draw_yes_casts_for_miracle_cost` — first draw + yes + {2} available puts the spell on the stack and removes it from hand.\n- `test_first_draw_yes_pays_two_not_full_cost` — a {2}{U} sorcery cast with only {2} in the pool proves the {2} alternative cost is paid (pool empty after).\n- `test_first_draw_no_leaves_card_in_hand` — declining leaves the card in hand, stack empty, no mana spent.\n- `test_not_first_draw_does_not_offer_miracle` — first-card gating: with `cards_drawn_this_turn` pre-set, the second draw offers no miracle (empty yes/no script would raise loudly if it wrongly fired).\n- `test_first_draw_yes_without_mana_keeps_card_in_hand` — yes but empty pool fails gracefully, card stays in hand.\n- `test_stamp_is_readable_via_engine_helper` — Lorehold's {2} stamp is what `engine.miracle.get_miracle_cost` reads.\n\nNo existing tests were modified or removed. Files updated:\n- /workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/untestable.json (emptied to `[]`)"}],"totalDurationMs":114561,"totalTokens":59741,"totalToolUseCount":23,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":224,"cache_read_input_tokens":58900,"output_tokens":615,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":224},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":615,"cache_read_input_tokens":58900,"cache_creation_input_tokens":224,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":224,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":11,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":3,"editFileCount":6,"linesAdded":227,"linesRemoved":34,"otherToolCount":0}}}
