{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017JmwaqD561S7ZjDHKhYqgt","type":"tool_result","content":"68\t\n69\t@dataclass\n70\tclass BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n71\t    pass\n72\t\n73\t\n74\t@dataclass\n75\tclass BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\n76\t    \"\"\"Fired at the start of each main phase (precombat and postcombat).\n77\t\n78\t    Mirrors :class:`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`.  ``player`` is the\n79\t    active player whose main phase is beginning, and ``phase`` is the\n80\t    :class:`~engine.types.Phase` value (``PRECOMBAT_MAIN`` / ``POSTCOMBAT_MAIN``)\n81\t    so triggers can distinguish the two main phases when needed.\n82\t    \"\"\"\n83\t\n84\t    player: Any = None\n85\t    phase: Any = None\n86\t\n87\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KJdZ123z2qLi1oGQBQmHEr","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"b60dbf4d-db42-470b-9443-d722866adc0e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:42:46.822Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_201 implementation"}
