{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018ZKXNAheBU2dyH7X25txSF","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/miracle.py:19:  miracle/alternative cost) onto a card and mark it ``has_miracle = True``.\nengine/miracle.py:20:* :func:`clear_miracle_cost` — remove the stamp (used when the granting\nengine/miracle.py:53:    Sets both ``card.miracle_cost`` and a ``card.has_miracle`` boolean flag\nengine/miracle.py:57:    card.has_miracle = True\nengine/miracle.py:60:def clear_miracle_cost(card: Any) -> None:\nengine/miracle.py:67:    card.has_miracle = False\ncards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py:96:    def apply_miracle_grant(self, game: \"GameState\") -> None:\ncards/sos/sos_201/tests.py:155:    def test_hand_instant_has_miracle_two(self) -> None:\ncards/sos/sos_201/tests.py:164:    def test_hand_sorcery_has_miracle_two(self) -> None:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KJdZ123z2qLi1oGQBQmHEr","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"3a0170e8-3fcd-41ac-bf7a-3dc721cda2cd","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:42:57.199Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_201 implementation"}
