{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013PZwn7oeBUtZimmnuPYcG6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KxVSzdbZavgXLWXroPpUB6","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/engine/casting.py","old_string":"    Unlike :func:`cast_spell` this skips the normal sorcery-speed/instant\n    timing check (miracle casts happen at draw time, outside normal timing),\n    but otherwise mirrors the cast pipeline: ``can_cast`` legality, target\n    choice/validation, mana payment (with rollback on failure), the\n    ``on_cast`` hook, and pushing a resolving :class:`StackObject`.","new_string":"    Unlike :func:`cast_spell` this skips the normal sorcery-speed/instant\n    timing check (miracle casts happen at draw time, outside normal timing),\n    but otherwise mirrors the cast pipeline: ``can_cast`` legality, target\n    choice/validation, mana payment (with rollback on failure), the\n    ``on_cast`` hook, and pushing a resolving :class:`StackObject`.\n\n    Note: cost reduction (``get_cost_reduction``) is intentionally NOT applied\n    to *alternative_cost* — unlike :func:`cast_spell`, an alternative cost such\n    as miracle is paid exactly as printed.  Callers wanting reductions on an\n    alternative cost must fold them into *alternative_cost* before calling."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":47986,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":596,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015Db1w2LmRhkJgHeDaM9a5T","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"c418a676-75d0-4971-b023-5c41fdec37e1","request_id":"req_011CbcV1EFrMETePXycrN8GX","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revis