{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DzTZUDCci4uB8Xfy4pexcF","type":"tool_result","content":"380\t# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n381\t# Cast spell paying an alternative cost (e.g. miracle)\n382\t# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n383\t\n384\t\n385\tdef cast_spell_alternative(\n386\t    game: GameState,\n387\t    player: Player,\n388\t    card: CardImpl,\n389\t    alternative_cost: ManaCost,\n390\t    from_zone: Zone = Zone.HAND,\n391\t) -> None:\n392\t    \"\"\"Cast *card* paying *alternative_cost* instead of its mana cost.\n393\t\n394\t    Used by alternative-cost mechanics such as **miracle** (rule 702.94),\n395\t    where the spell is cast \"by paying [cost] rather than its mana cost\".\n396\t    The alternative cost is paid as a normal mana cost from *player*'s pool.\n397\t\n398\t    Unlike :func:`cast_spell` this skips the normal sorcery-speed/instant\n399\t    timing check (miracle casts happen at draw time, outside normal timing),\n400\t    but otherwise mirrors the cast pipeline: ``can_cast`` legality, target\n401\t    choice/validation, mana payment (with rollback on failure), the\n402\t    ``on_cast`` hook, and pushing a resolving :class:`StackObject`.\n403\t\n404\t    Parameters:\n405\t        game: The current game state.\n406\t        player: The player casting the spell.\n407\t        card: The card to cast (must be in *from_zone*).\n408\t        alternative_cost: The :class:`ManaCost` to pay instead of\n409\t            ``card.mana_cost``.\n410\t        from_zone: The zone the card is currently in (default hand).\n411\t\n412\t    Raises:\n413\t        CastingError: If any legality check fails or mana cannot be paid.\n414\t    \"\"\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015Db1w2LmRhkJgHeDaM9a5T","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"f7c26be1-c989-40ae-b721-c90528505662","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:45:48.165Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_201 implementation"}
