{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TFrGeEGn5BVsnbYPmFzB4z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01REuWesB35Zq9iQ89C9JpHb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Engine: miracle mechanic + alternative-cost casting (sos_201)\n- Miracle is NOT a Keyword enum member (engine_tests pins len(Keyword)==16). It is\n  modelled in `engine/miracle.py`: set/get/clear_miracle_cost (stamp helpers),\n  `is_first_draw_this_turn(player)` (reads `player.cards_drawn_this_turn`, reset to\n  0 at the untap step in engine/turn.py), `derive_miracle_cost(game, player, card)`\n  (DYNAMICALLY queries the drawer's battlefield for permanents exposing a callable\n  `miracle_cost(game, card)` grant — e.g. Lorehold), and `offer_miracle`.\n- `engine.game.draw_card` calls `offer_miracle` on every draw; the grant is derived\n  dynamically (not a sticky stamp) so it ends when the granter leaves play, and a\n  naturally-drawn card gets the offer with no pre-stamping. Scoped to the active\n  player's own draw.\n- A miracle/alternative-cost grant on a permanent is exposed as a\n  `miracle_cost(game, card) -> ManaCost | None` method returning the cost for\n  controller-hand instants/sorceries.\n- `engine.casting.cast_spell_alternative(game, player, card, alternative_cost, from_zone=HAND)`:\n  mirrors the normal cast pipeline but pays an explicit alternative cost (no cost\n  reduction applied) and skips sorcery/instant timing. Use for alternative-cost\n  mechanics (miracle, etc.).\nEOF\ngit add cards/sos/sos_201/ engine/miracle.py engine/game.py engine/casting.py engine/turn.py FILES_MODIFIED.json KEY_DECISIONS.md RUN_DECISIONS.md && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat: implement card sos_201\n\nLorehold, the Historian: 5/5 Flying/Haste Elder Dragon that grants\nmiracle {2} to the controller's hand instants/sorceries and a loot trigger\non each opponent's upkeep. Adds an additive miracle engine surface\n(engine/miracle.py with dynamic grant derivation at draw time) and\nengine.casting.cast_spell_alternative for alternative-cost casts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Log conventions and commit sos_201"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":661,"cache_read_input_tokens":116667,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":661},"output_tokens":57,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"9dac00d9-24f1-4bc1-a730-230b8fa612ae","request_id":"req_011CbcVFLM7RJptvVT7F2Geu"}
