{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uxwxg6hq4XR8S8HE6GymCA","type":"tool_result","content":"5108:702.153. Casualty\n5110:[Omitted long matching line]\n5112:702.153b If a spell has multiple instances of casualty, each is paid separately and triggers based on the payments made for it, not any other instance of casualty.\n7340:Casualty\n7341:A keyword ability that allows you to sacrifice a creature to create a copy of a spell. See 702.153, “Casualty.”"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VHujhzSrizXureD9tNErgr","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"595be289-d050-489a-8c60-1266a0c94766","timestamp":"2026-06-01T11:50:12.430Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_226"}
