stable_count: 2\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 21 test cases for sos_226 Silverquill, the Disputant (static data, spell-cast casualty-grant trigger registration, casualty scope/copy/optional-cost, off-battlefield); 15 fail red-phase, 6 are scope-guard negatives.\n\nKey files:\n- /workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-rationale.md\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-files.txt\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/untestable.json\n\nNote for the Implementer: casualty is a brand-new mechanic with no engine surface, and `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is defined but never fired by `engine.casting.cast_spell`. The tests pin the casualty grant via a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger registered by `register_triggers` (FDN-92 pattern): on resolve it should ask `choose_yes_no`, pick a power>=1 creature via `choose_card`, sacrifice it (`engine.game.sacrifice`), and push a copy (`engine.stack.copy_spell`). Two genuinely under-specified requirements (the true \"as you cast\" additional-cost timing and the new-target choice for the copy) are recorded in `untestable.json`."}],"totalDurationMs":204572,"totalTokens":96234,"totalToolUseCount":39,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2900,"cache_read_input_tokens":92759,"output_tokens":573,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2900},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":92759,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2900,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":24,"searchCount":7,"bashCount":4,"editFileCount":4,"linesAdded":493,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
