es through the real cast pipeline (the SpellCastTriggeredEvent is fired by cast_spell, the trigger is pushed/resolvable), leading to the sacrifice + copy when accepted.\n2. New-target choice for the copy: cast/resolve a TARGETED spell with casualty, pay it, choose NEW targets for the copy, and assert the copy resolves against the newly-chosen target (different from the original).\n\nRead the implementation/engine source to use the REAL APIs and DeterministicPlayer scripts. Follow existing test conventions. Do NOT modify or break existing tests.\n\nAfter writing, run `pytest cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py` and confirm ALL tests pass.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Update /workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py with new tests.\n- Append new coverage to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-rationale.md.\n- Empty /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/untestable.json to [] (or note any genuinely-remaining items).\n\nReturn a short status: total tests now, how many new, all passing (yes/no), remaining untestable_count."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2067,"cache_read_input_tokens":132126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2067},"output_tokens":46,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"2b7aa6df-a802-41b4-82de-ec5d8453cfff","request_id":"req_011CbcW65DPwVbQWLhsLR7AH"}
