{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01VN97NnvoifEMiYZoBH2nej","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XGTrBhNnak7HSBXW7CHjKt","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/test-rationale.md","old_string":"## Note on currently-passing negative tests","new_string":"## Added coverage — previously-untestable requirements now exercised\n\nThe Implementer landed the full card plus an additive engine change\n(`engine.casting.cast_spell` now fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` after pushing\nthe spell's StackObject, and `engine.stack.copy_spell` supports `new_targets`),\nunblocking the two items previously recorded in `untestable.json`. Six new\ntests cover them end-to-end through the real cast pipeline.\n\n### TestSilverquillCasualtyThroughRealCast — \"as you cast\" via cast_spell\n- `test_real_cast_queues_casualty_trigger_above_the_spell` — casting a\n  controller instant through `engine.casting.cast_spell` (paying mana, real\n  timing) leaves the spell on the stack with the casualty trigger pushed above\n  it. Verifies the trigger fires through the real cast pipeline (not a manually\n  fired event). Covers untestable item #1.\n- `test_real_cast_paying_casualty_sacrifices_and_copies` — resolving that\n  casualty trigger after choosing to pay sacrifices the creature\n  (battlefield → graveyard) and puts exactly one distinct copy (same name,\n  different object) of the spell on the stack above the original.\n- `test_real_cast_declining_casualty_makes_no_copy` — declining the casualty on\n  a real cast keeps the creature and leaves only the original spell on the stack\n  (no copy). Optional-cost guard through the real pipeline.\n\n### TestSilverquillCasualtyNewTargets — copy chooses NEW targets\nUses a minimal targeted instant (`_PingInstant`, 1 damage to target creature)\nwhose `on_resolve` reads `chosen_targets`, so a re-targeted copy marks damage on\na different creature — making the new-target choice observable.\n- `test_copy_can_retarget_a_different_creature` — cast the ping at the original\n  creature, pay casualty, choose new targets, pick a different creature. The\n  copy's `targets` is the new creature and resolving it marks damage on the\n  NEW target while the original takes none. Covers untestable item #2.\n- `test_copy_keeps_original_target_when_retarget_declined` — declining the\n  re-target prompt keeps the copy on the original target (new-target choice is\n  optional); the copy hits the original and a bystander takes no damage.\n\n(Target creatures in these two tests are 0-power so the dedicated power-1\n\"Sacrifice\" creature is the sole eligible casualty — keeping the sacrifice\nauto-selected and the scripts unambiguous.)\n\n## Note on currently-passing negative tests"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":321,"cache_read_input_tokens":74470,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":321,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NGPgShq7ufcrA89j3njWbF","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"88ee6c06-5001-4d4c-80e3-2d56e43add7c","request_id":"req_011CbcWHQ61XiH79yXD7bSPc","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_226"}
