{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DMWSC4s1Pore3Pk6gUCd8d","type":"tool_result","content":"86-# Cost reduction\n87-# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n88-\n89:def get_cost_reduction(game: GameState, card: CardImpl, controller: Player) -> int:\n90-    \"\"\"Return the generic mana reduction for casting *card*.\n91-\n92-    Queries ``card.cost_reduction(game)`` and clamps the result so that\n--\n102-    card.controller = controller\n103-    raw = card.cost_reduction(game)\n104-    # Restore previous controller in case the caller doesn't want a\n105:    # side-effect (get_cost_reduction is a query, not a mutation).\n106-    card.controller = prev_controller\n107-    # Additively fold in any granted reductions from permanents on the\n108-    # battlefield that dynamically grant cost reduction to *controller*'s\n--\n254-    # explicit controller assignment.\n255-    if card.controller is None:\n256-        card.controller = player\n257:    reduction = get_cost_reduction(game, card, player)\n258-    effective_cost = _apply_cost_reduction(card.mana_cost, reduction) if reduction > 0 else card.mana_cost\n259-\n260-    if not player.mana_pool.can_pay(effective_cost):\n--\n469-    choice/validation, mana payment (with rollback on failure), the\n470-    ``on_cast`` hook, and pushing a resolving :class:`StackObject`.\n471-\n472:    Note: cost reduction (``get_cost_reduction``) is intentionally NOT applied\n473-    to *alternative_cost* — unlike :func:`cast_spell`, an alternative cost such\n474-    as miracle is paid exactly as printed.  Callers that want a reduction on an\n475-    alternative cost must fold it into *alternative_cost* before calling."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018LVqqkhmpevT52yENkiaDb","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"a234f769-543e-47f2-8eba-444c01722b5e","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:10:02.822Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_245 impl