{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EbkiJF6w6fdS5HkphSA9SA","type":"tool_result","content":"12:The cost-reduction model the engine exposes is ``CardImpl.cost_reduction(game)``\n14:``engine.casting.get_cost_reduction`` which clamps the result to the generic\n22:  through the real ``cast_spell`` pipeline (the spell's ``mana_spent`` is\n24:  canonical ``get_cost_reduction`` query. Scope: only the controller's\n37:from engine.casting import cast_spell as engine_cast_spell, get_cost_reduction\n138:        assert card.cost_reduction(game) == 0\n147:        assert card.cost_reduction(game) == 2\n156:        assert card.cost_reduction(game) == 2\n166:        assert card.cost_reduction(game) == 1\n183:        assert card.cost_reduction(game) == 1\n185:    def test_get_cost_reduction_clamped_to_generic(self) -> None:\n194:        reduction = get_cost_reduction(game, card, p1)\n197:    def test_get_cost_reduction_matches_creature_count_under_generic(self) -> None:\n203:        assert get_cost_reduction(game, card, p1) == 3\n216:        less mana (mana_spent reflects the affinity reduction).\"\"\"\n232:        assert spell.mana_spent == 4\n251:        assert spell.mana_spent == 5\n253:    def test_granted_reduction_visible_via_get_cost_reduction(self) -> None:\n255:        get_cost_reduction query for a controller instant while Witherbloom is\n265:        assert get_cost_reduction(game, spell, p1) == 3\n276:        assert get_cost_reduction(game, spell, p1) == 0\n293:        assert get_cost_reduction(game, opp_spell, p2) == 0\n310:        assert get_cost_reduction(game, creature_spell, p1) == 0\n323:        assert get_cost_reduction(game, spell, p1) == 2"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018LVqqkhmpevT52yENkiaDb","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"48e6e0f6-519f-4eda-a0dd-3be7d4705c3b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:10:19.308Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_245 implementation"}
