{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01KGDjzC8nopkA4NSnG9imrd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Tcd8Hmvpt2dkmD8yctxwKS","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/coordinator-directives.md","content":"# Coordinator Directives — sos_257 (initial implementation)\n\nCard: **Great Hall of the Biblioplex** — Land.\n- `{T}: Add {C}.`\n- `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an\n  instant or sorcery spell.`\n- `{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with\n  \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until\n  end of turn.\" It's still a land.`\n\nThe Tester escalated two untestable items. Handle them as follows.\n\n## Requirements to implement fully\n1. **Static**: Land, no mana cost, colorless (empty colors), not a creature by\n   default, cannot be cast.\n2. **Two mana abilities** (use the engine ManaAbility surface; follow FDN land\n   precedents Plains/FDN 272 and Secluded Courtyard/FDN 267):\n   - `{T}: Add {C}` — taps, produces one colorless.\n   - `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color` — pays 1 life, taps, produces\n     one mana of the controller's chosen color.\n3. **`{5}` animation**: if NOT already a creature, the land becomes a 2/4 Wizard\n   creature and remains a LAND. Guard against re-animation stacking (the \"isn't a\n   creature\" clause). While animated it has the granted trigger below.\n\n## Untestable item 1 — mana spend restriction → ACCEPT AS UNENFORCED (option b)\n\"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\" The engine has NO\nsurface for tagging mana with a spend restriction; the FDN reference card\nSecluded Courtyard (cards/fdn/fdn_267) documents this exact limitation as\nunenforced. DO NOT build a mana-tagging engine subsystem for this. Implement the\nability to produce any-color mana (with the life payment) and add a grep-able\nmarker comment in card_impl.py:\n`# UNVERIFIED: \"spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" — engine has no mana spend-restriction surface (matches FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard limitation).`\nThis is an accepted, documented gap consistent with the existing codebase.\n\n## Untestable item 2 — granted +1/+0 cast trigger → BUILD A TESTABLE CONTRACT (option a)\nThis is now feasible: `engine.casting.cast_spell` fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`\n(sos_226 work). Implement the granted ability fully and expose a STABLE,\nOBSERVABLE contract:\n- While the permanent is a creature (animated), register a controller-scoped\n  `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger that, for each instant/sorcery the controller\n  casts, gives this creature +1/+0 until end of turn.\n- Make it observable: the animated creature's POWER increases by 1 per\n  instant/sorcery spell the controller casts this turn (and resets at end of\n  turn). The trigger must only exist/fire while animated (CREATURE in card_types),\n  and only for the controller's instant/sorcery spells.\nDocument the exact contract (how the trigger is registered while animated, and\nthat power increases by 1 per cast) in your rationale so the Tester can assert it.\nAfter you finish, the Tester will be re-invoked to cover this.\n\n## Constraints\n- Additive engine changes only if needed; no renames/moves/deletes; keep\n  len(Keyword)==16; do not modify test files.\n- All existing 23 tests in cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py must pass.\n- Run pytest for the card, engine_tests/, cards/fdn/, cards/sos/.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2804,"cache_read_input_tokens":150451,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2804},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-94