d does NOT drain life).\n- get_activated_abilities returns exactly one ActivatedAbility for the {5} animation: consumes 5 generic mana (fails with only 4); after activation + continuous-effect recompute the permanent gains CREATURE type but keeps LAND; becomes 2/4; gains Wizard subtype; re-animation while already a creature does not stack/double.\n\nREFERENCES (read for API discovery — rich docstrings):\n- engine/card.py (Land, ManaAbility, ActivatedAbility, continuous effects/animation), engine/continuous_effects.py, engine/casting.py (SpellCastTriggeredEvent now fired), engine/events.py, engine/triggers.py, engine/types.py\n- FDN land references: cards/fdn/fdn_272 (Plains), cards/fdn/fdn_267 (Secluded Courtyard — documents the mana-spend-restriction engine limitation). Look for any FDN manland / becomes-a-creature land for the animation pattern.\n- KEY_DECISIONS.md (card colors; SpellCastTriggeredEvent fired by cast_spell; until-end-of-turn pump conventions).\n- RULEBOOK.txt (grep, don't read whole) for animation (\"becomes a ... creature. It's still a land\").\n\nENGINE RULES (from AGENTS.md):\n- Additive only: may add methods/classes/helpers/files, modify existing function bodies; MUST NOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols; MUST NOT break engine_tests pinned counts (len(Keyword)==16); MUST NOT modify test files.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Read spec, test file, rationale, directives.\n2. Implement the card so ALL 23 tests in tests.py pass, plus the granted +1/+0 cast-trigger with a testable contract (per directives).\n3. Run `pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`, `pytest engine_tests/`, `pytest cards/fdn/`, `pytest cards/sos/` to confirm nothing breaks.\n4. If a test is genuinely WRONG, do NOT modify it — return DISPUTE with details.\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Implementation to /workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py (+ any engine changes).\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl.diff — `git diff` of all changes.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md — what you did, the EXACT granted-trigger contract (how registered while animated, power increases per cast, end-of-turn reset), the UNVERIFIED marker for the mana restriction, engine changes, any spec deviations.\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-files.txt — modified files.\n- Upsert this card's entry into /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json (match by card: \"sos_257\"). Keep other entries intact.\n\nReturn either IMPL_DONE (files_changed, tests_passing, diff_path, rationale_path, notes) or DISPUTE (tests_failing, disputed_tests, dispute_path, notes) exactly as specified."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqRHg8PRQF4DMAnkhcGpdm","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"b4c04d60-ef9b-453f-bb43-e2fa815318d2","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:14:43.065Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
