{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JX7wef5Ymh5jGJMiWAbXcu","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives — sos_257 (initial implementation)\n2\t\n3\tCard: **Great Hall of the Biblioplex** — Land.\n4\t- `{T}: Add {C}.`\n5\t- `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast an\n6\t  instant or sorcery spell.`\n7\t- `{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with\n8\t  \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until\n9\t  end of turn.\" It's still a land.`\n10\t\n11\tThe Tester escalated two untestable items. Handle them as follows.\n12\t\n13\t## Requirements to implement fully\n14\t1. **Static**: Land, no mana cost, colorless (empty colors), not a creature by\n15\t   default, cannot be cast.\n16\t2. **Two mana abilities** (use the engine ManaAbility surface; follow FDN land\n17\t   precedents Plains/FDN 272 and Secluded Courtyard/FDN 267):\n18\t   - `{T}: Add {C}` — taps, produces one colorless.\n19\t   - `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color` — pays 1 life, taps, produces\n20\t     one mana of the controller's chosen color.\n21\t3. **`{5}` animation**: if NOT already a creature, the land becomes a 2/4 Wizard\n22\t   creature and remains a LAND. Guard against re-animation stacking (the \"isn't a\n23\t   creature\" clause). While animated it has the granted trigger below.\n24\t\n25\t## Untestable item 1 — mana spend restriction → ACCEPT AS UNENFORCED (option b)\n26\t\"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell.\" The engine has NO\n27\tsurface for tagging mana with a spend restriction; the FDN reference card\n28\tSecluded Courtyard (cards/fdn/fdn_267) documents this exact limitation as\n29\tunenforced. DO NOT build a mana-tagging engine subsystem for this. Implement the\n30\tability to produce any-color mana (with the life payment) and add a grep-able\n31\tmarker comment in card_impl.py:\n32\t`# UNVERIFIED: \"spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" — engine has no mana spend-restriction surface (matches FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard limitation).`\n33\tThis is an accepted, documented gap consistent with the existing codebase.\n34\t\n35\t## Untestable item 2 — granted +1/+0 cast trigger → BUILD A TESTABLE CONTRACT (option a)\n36\tThis is now feasible: `engine.casting.cast_spell` fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`\n37\t(sos_226 work). Implement the granted ability fully and expose a STABLE,\n38\tOBSERVABLE contract:\n39\t- While the permanent is a creature (animated), register a controller-scoped\n40\t  `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger that, for each instant/sorcery the controller\n41\t  casts, gives this creature +1/+0 until end of turn.\n42\t- Make it observable: the animated creature's POWER increases by 1 per\n43\t  instant/sorcery spell the controller casts this turn (and resets at end of\n44\t  turn). The trigger must only exist/fire while animated (CREATURE in card_types),\n45\t  and only for the controller's instant/sorcery spells.\n46\tDocument the exact contract (how the trigger is registered while animated, and\n47\tthat power increases by 1 per cast) in your rationale so the Tester can assert it.\n48\tAfter you finish, the Tester will be re-invoked to cover this.\n49\t\n50\t## Constraints\n51\t- Additive engine changes only if needed; no renames/moves/deletes; keep\n52\t  len(Keyword)==16; do not modify test files.\n53\t- All existing 23 tests in cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py must pass.\n54\t- Run pytest for the card, engine_tests/, cards/fdn/, cards/sos/.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqRHg8PRQF4DMAnkhcGpdm","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"3ee76c25-6b4f-442c-af6a-e5e3823477cd","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:14:46.659Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
