{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0165oTdvGEbREWGo8Ldg58bt","type":"tool_result","content":"15:# Maximum hand size — players discard down to this during cleanup.\n94:def _do_cleanup_step(game: GameState) -> None:\n95:    \"\"\"Perform the cleanup step (MTG rule §514).\n97:    The cleanup step executes the following actions in order:\n101:    2. Remove all \"until end of turn\" continuous effects via\n102:       :meth:`EffectManager.remove_expired`, then reapply remaining\n109:    7. If triggers fired during cleanup (e.g. from discarding), process\n110:       them (give priority, resolve stack) and perform another cleanup step.\n131:                f\"{exc_name} during cleanup discard for {active.name}; \"\n141:    # --- Step 2: Remove \"until end of turn\" continuous effects ---\n143:        game.effect_manager.remove_expired(game)\n176:    # triggered during cleanup, another cleanup step occurs.\n180:        # After resolving, perform another cleanup step (recursive).\n181:        _do_cleanup_step(game)\n227:            _do_cleanup_step(game)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqRHg8PRQF4DMAnkhcGpdm","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"9f6ddfb4-d60c-4745-8b97-7ac89403fbb2","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:16:00.232Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
