{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KbTRw6GNVx1b9VSFWLeHRt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale — sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n2\t\n3\t## Approach\n4\t`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` subclasses `engine.card.Land`. No engine changes were\n5\tneeded — `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is already fired by `engine.casting.cast_spell`\n6\t(sos_226 work) and the continuous-effect layer system already supports the\n7\tanimation pattern.\n8\t\n9\t## Static data\n10\tLand with no mana cost, empty `colors` (colorless), `CardType.LAND` only by\n11\tdefault (no CREATURE), `can_cast` inherited as `False`.\n12\t\n13\t## Two mana abilities (`get_mana_abilities`)\n14\t- `{T}: Add {C}` — cost callable `(game, src)` taps the source (fails if already\n15\t  tapped), `mana_produced` adds one `ManaType.COLORLESS`.\n16\t- `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color` — cost callable taps the source\n17\t  and pays 1 life **only on success**; if the source is already tapped it\n18\t  returns `False` BEFORE touching life (failed activation does not drain life).\n19\t  `mana_produced` asks `controller.choose([...colors...])` and adds the chosen\n20\t  color. Color choice is scripted in tests via `player._script.appendleft(color)`.\n21\t\n22\tBoth cost callables take `(game, src)` matching the FDN 267 precedent and the\n23\ttest invocation `ability.cost(game, card)` / `ability.mana_produced(game)`.\n24\t\n25\t## `{5}` animation (`get_activated_abilities`)\n26\tExactly one `ActivatedAbility`. Cost pays `ManaCost(generic=5)` from the\n27\tcontroller's pool (fails with only 4). `effect` calls `_animate`, which:\n28\t- Guards re-animation: no-op if `CardType.CREATURE` is already present or the\n29\t  animation effects already exist (\"If this land isn't a creature ...\") so P/T\n30\t  never stacks.\n31\t- Registers two permanent (`DURATION_PERMANENT`) continuous effects:\n32\t  - Layer 4 (TYPE): adds `CardType.CREATURE` to `card_types` (LAND retained) and\n33\t    the `\"Wizard\"` subtype.\n34\t  - Layer 7b (SET_PT): sets `modified_power`/`modified_toughness` to 2/4.\n35\t- Calls `effect_manager.apply_all` so the type/PT are live immediately.\n36\t\n37\tLands have no P/T surface, so the card carries `base_power/base_toughness`\n38\t(both 0), `modified_power/modified_toughness`, and read-only `power`/`toughness`\n39\tproperties mirroring the Creature surface. `_reset_characteristics` is overridden\n40\tto reset `subtypes` and P/T to printed values (the base `Land` reset only handles\n41\t`card_types`/`keywords`), keeping `apply_all` idempotent.\n42\t\n43\t## Granted +1/+0 cast trigger — EXACT TESTABLE CONTRACT (directive item 2)\n44\t- Registered via `register_triggers` (and lazily on first animation) as a single\n45\t  controller-scoped `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` `TriggerRegistration`, guarded so it\n46\t  is **inert unless the permanent is currently a creature** (`CardType.CREATURE in\n47\t  card_types`) and on the battlefield.\n48\t- Condition fires only for the controller's own **instant or sorcery** spells\n49\t  (checks `event.spell`/`event.card` controller against `source.controller` and\n50\t  `spell.card_types & {INSTANT, SORCERY}`).\n51\t- Effect: each qualifying cast registers one Layer 7c (MODIFY_PT)\n52\t  `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` continuous effect that adds **+1** to `modified_power`,\n53\t  then recomputes effects.\n54\t- **Observable contract**: while animated, the creature's `power` increases by\n55\t  exactly 1 per instant/sorcery the controller casts this turn (toughness\n56\t  unchanged at 4), and the pumps are swept at the cleanup step\n57\t  (`EffectManager.remove_expired` removes `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` effects), so\n58\t  power resets to 2 at end of turn. The trigger never fires while the permanent\n59\t  is a non-creature land.\n60\t\n61\t## Untestable item 1 — mana spend restriction (directive item 1: ACCEPT AS UNENFORCED)\n62\tThe any-color mana is produced with no spend restriction. The exact grep-able\n63\tmarker is present in `card_impl.py` inside `_any_color_effect`:\n64\t`# UNVERIFIED: \"spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" — engine has no mana spend-restriction surface (matches FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard limitation).`\n65\t\n66\t## Engine changes\n67\tNone. Additive-only constraint respected; `len(Keyword)` untouched.\n68\t\n69\t## Spec deviations\n70\tNone. The card is implemented as written; the only documented gap is the\n71\tmana-spend restriction (item 1), which is an accepted codebase-wide limitation.\n72\t\n73\t## Test results\n74\t- `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`: 23 passed.\n75\t- `engine_tests/ cards/fdn/ cards/sos/`: 1455 passed.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"1bbac9ef-7fcd-48e0-98e6-88ea1378c4e1","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:17:54.535Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale — sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## Approach\n`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` subclasses `engine.card.Land`. No engine changes were\nneeded — `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is already fired by `engine.casting.cast_spell`\n(sos_226 work) and the continuous-effect layer system already supports the\nanimation pattern.\n\n## Static data\nLand with no mana cost, empty `colors` (colorless), `CardType.LAND` only by\ndefault (no CREATURE), `can_cast` inherited as `False`.\n\n## Two mana abilities (`get_mana_abilities`)\n- `{T}: Add {C}` — cost callable `(game, src)` taps the source (fails if already\n  tapped), `mana_produced` adds one `ManaType.COLORLESS`.\n- `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color` — cost callable taps the source\n  and pays 1 life **only on success**; if the source is already tapped it\n  returns `False` BEFORE touching life (failed activation does not drain life).\n  `mana_produced` asks `controller.choose([...colors...])` and adds the chosen\n  color. Color choice is scripted in tests via `player._script.appendleft(color)`.\n\nBoth cost callables take `(game, src)` matching the FDN 267 precedent and the\ntest invocation `ability.cost(game, card)` / `ability.mana_produced(game)`.\n\n## `{5}` animation (`get_activated_abilities`)\nExactly one `ActivatedAbility`. Cost pays `ManaCost(generic=5)` from the\ncontroller's pool (fails with only 4). `effect` calls `_animate`, which:\n- Guards re-animation: no-op if `CardType.CREATURE` is already present or the\n  animation effects already exist (\"If this land isn't a creature ...\") so P/T\n  never stacks.\n- Registers two permanent (`DURATION_PERMANENT`) continuous effects:\n  - Layer 4 (TYPE): adds `CardType.CREATURE` to `card_types` (LAND retained) and\n    the `\"Wizard\"` subtype.\n  - Layer 7b (SET_PT): sets `modified_power`/`modified_toughness` to 2/4.\n- Calls `effect_manager.apply_all` so the type/PT are live immediately.\n\nLands have no P/T surface, so the card carries `base_power/base_toughness`\n(both 0), `modified_power/modified_toughness`, and read-only `power`/`toughness`\nproperties mirroring the Creature surface. `_reset_characteristics` is overridden\nto reset `subtypes` and P/T to printed values (the base `Land` reset only handles\n`card_types`/`keywords`), keeping `apply_all` idempotent.\n\n## Granted +1/+0 cast trigger — EXACT TESTABLE CONTRACT (directive item 2)\n- Registered via `register_triggers` (and lazily on first animation) as a single\n  controller-scoped `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` `TriggerRegistration`, guarded so it\n  is **inert unless the permanent is currently a creature** (`CardType.CREATURE in\n  card_types`) and on the battlefield.\n- Condition fires only for the controller's own **instant or sorcery** spells\n  (checks `event.spell`/`event.card` controller against `source.controller` and\n  `spell.card_types & {INSTANT, SORCERY}`).\n- Effect: each qualifying cast registers one Layer 7c (MODIFY_PT)\n  `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` continuous effect that adds **+1** to `modified_power`,\n  then recomputes effects.\n- **Observable contract**: while animated, the creature's `power` increases by\n  exactly 1 per instant/sorcery the controller casts this turn (toughness\n  unchanged at 4), and the pumps are swept at the cleanup step\n  (`EffectManager.remove_expired` removes `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` effects), so\n  power resets to 2 at end of turn. The trigger never fires while the permanent\n  is a non-creature land.\n\n## Untestable item 1 — mana spend restriction (directive item 1: ACCEPT AS UNENFORCED)\nThe any-color mana is produced with no spend restriction. The exact grep-able\nmarker is present in `card_impl.py` inside `_any_color_effect`:\n`# UNVERIFIED: \"spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" — engine has no mana spend-restriction surface (matches FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard limitation).`\n\n## Engine changes\nNone. Additive-only constraint respected; `len(Keyword)` untouched.\n\n## Spec deviations\nNone. The card is implemented as written; the only documented gap is the\nmana-spend restriction (item 1), which is an accepted codebase-wide limitation.\n\n## Test results\n- `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`: 23 passed.\n- `engine_tests/ cards/fdn/ cards/sos/`: 1455 passed.\n","numLines":76,"startLine":1,"totalLines":76}}}
