{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01UrHinrScPYgvtkeWQ6wWAm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015hrMMzcZDSuiPPTyjcY63S","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md","old_string":"### TestGreatHallAnimation — the `{5}` animation ability","new_string":"### TestGreatHallGrantedCastTrigger — the granted +1/+0 cast trigger (only while animated)\n\nAdded after the Coordinator accepted the Implementer's stable, observable\ncontract for the granted ability *\"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery\nspell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\"* (directive item 2). The\ncontract is driven end-to-end through the real engine: the trigger is\nregistered via `register_triggers` (as it would be on ETB), the land is\nanimated through the `{5}` ability, spells are cast via\n`engine.casting.cast_spell` (which fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`), the whole\nstack is resolved (so the pump trigger applies), and the until-end-of-turn\npumps are swept via the engine's `_do_cleanup_step`. The observable surface is\nthe creature's `power`/`toughness`.\n\n- `test_one_instant_cast_pumps_power_by_one` — animated, controller casts one\n  instant: power goes 2 → 3, toughness stays 4 (+1/+0, exactly one cast).\n- `test_one_sorcery_cast_pumps_power_by_one` — same, for a sorcery (the ability\n  fires for both instants and sorceries).\n- `test_multiple_casts_stack` — three qualifying casts (instant, sorcery,\n  instant) pump power 2 → 3 → 4 → 5; toughness never changes.\n- `test_pumps_expire_at_cleanup` — after two casts (power 4) the cleanup step\n  sweeps the DURATION_END_OF_TURN pumps; power resets to the base 2/4 while the\n  permanent animation SET_PT effect survives.\n- `test_no_pump_while_not_animated` — a non-creature (un-animated) Great Hall\n  gets no +1/+0 on a controller's instant cast (the trigger condition gates on\n  `CardType.CREATURE` being present); power stays 0.\n- `test_no_pump_for_opponent_spell` — the opponent casting an instant does NOT\n  pump the controller's animated creature (\"Whenever **you** cast …\"); power\n  stays 2/4.\n- `test_no_pump_for_noncreature_nonspell_type` — casting a creature spell (not\n  an instant or sorcery) does NOT trigger the ability; power stays 2/4.\n\n### TestGreatHallAnimation — the `{5}` animation ability"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":456,"cache_read_input_tokens":80798,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":456,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YLHhg3L6wmRAMxiCoeYbvX","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"2dfcf82b-0836-4dcf-a421-7b50b830c689","request_id":"req_011CbcXe7NP9ef7Q2GPCKBX6","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_257"}
