ation: only if not already a creature (re-animation must not stack/double P/T); becomes 2/4 Wizard; retains LAND type. Verify the continuous-effect layers (type layer adds CREATURE + Wizard, P/T set to 2/4) and the re-animation guard.\n- Granted +1/+0 cast trigger: only while animated (CREATURE in card_types) and on battlefield; only for the CONTROLLER's instant/sorcery spells; +1/+0 until end of turn per cast, swept at cleanup. Verify it cannot fire while a non-creature land or for opponent/non-instant-sorcery spells.\n- ACCEPTED LIMITATION — do NOT flag as strict: \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" is intentionally UNENFORCED (engine has no mana spend-restriction surface; matches FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard). The code carries a `# UNVERIFIED:` marker. This is a Coordinator-accepted gap. At most advisory.\n- Do NOT demand test rewrites (advisory only for test quality).\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Write /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json — JSON array of {\"severity\":\"strict\"|\"advisory\",\"file\",\"line\",\"comment\"}. Empty array [] if none.\n\nReturn:\nREVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: <N>\nadvisory_count: <N>\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json","agentId":"a5571bc1db987cb6a","agentType":"Reviewer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REVIEW_DONE\nstrict_count: 0\nadvisory_count: 3\nreview_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json"}],"totalDurationMs":67111,"totalTokens":41525,"totalToolUseCount":16,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":797,"cache_read_input_tokens":40673,"output_tokens":53,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":797},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":53,"cache_read_input_tokens":40673,"cache_creation_input_tokens":797,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":797,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed"