{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01CgjAuP3CbXKtySAqE7NGbi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GN2yfgp5meHc4vfETmH9nf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Convention: manland animation + granted cast trigger (sos_257)\n- Manland animation ({N}: becomes a creature, still a land) via continuous effects:\n  a permanent (DURATION_PERMANENT) Layer-4 TYPE effect adds CardType.CREATURE (+\n  subtype) while RETAINING the existing LAND type, plus a Layer-7b SET_PT effect\n  setting power/toughness. Guard re-animation by no-op'ing if CREATURE already in\n  card_types. Lands need base_power/base_toughness + modified_power/toughness +\n  read-only power/toughness properties; override _reset_characteristics to also\n  reset subtypes and P/T (the base Land reset only handles card_types/keywords).\n- \"Whenever you cast an instant/sorcery, this creature gets +1/+0 until EOT\"\n  granted only while animated: a controller-scoped SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger\n  gated on `CardType.CREATURE in card_types`; each qualifying cast registers a\n  DURATION_END_OF_TURN Layer-7c MODIFY_PT (+1 power) effect, swept at cleanup.\n- KNOWN limitation (accepted, codebase-wide): mana spend restrictions (\"spend this\n  mana only to cast an instant or sorcery\") are UNENFORCED — the engine has no\n  mana-tagging surface (matches FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard). Mark with a\n  `# UNVERIFIED:` comment rather than building a tagging subsystem.\nEOF\ngit add cards/sos/sos_257/ FILES_MODIFIED.json KEY_DECISIONS.md RUN_DECISIONS.md && git commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat: implement card sos_257\n\nGreat Hall of the Biblioplex: a land with {C} and any-color-for-1-life mana\nabilities and a {5} animation into a 2/4 Wizard creature (still a land) that\ngains +1/+0 until end of turn per instant/sorcery cast. No engine changes\nneeded. The mana spend-restriction is left unenforced per the FDN 267 pre