{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011dbFbdDniN4wZKScC3Hndo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 SOS cards are implemented, each in its own commit, with a clean working tree.\n\n## Summary\n\nI orchestrated a TDD Tester → Implementer → Reviewer loop for all 10 cards, one at a time. Final state: **1462 tests passing** (engine regression + FDN + all SOS), clean git tree, 10 feature commits.\n\n| Card | Card | Outcome |\n|------|------|---------|\n| sos_1 | The Dawning Archaic | Graveyard cost reduction + attack-trigger free-cast w/ exile replacement. **Engine:** `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent`, replaceable spell→graveyard resolution. |\n| sos_4 | Together as One | Converge sorcery (draw/damage/lifegain). No engine change. |\n| sos_13 | Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares | New **Prepared** mechanic. **Engine:** card/token `colors`, `cast_prepared_spell`. |\n| sos_57 | Mana Sculpt | Counter + delayed {C}. **Engine:** `last_payment_total`/`mana_spent`, `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`. |\n| sos_97 | Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer | Planeswalker (surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip turn-skip). **Engine:** `surveil`/`flip_coin`/`skip_turns` + real turn-skip in `advance_phase` (Reviewer-driven strict fix). |\n| sos_120 | Improvisation Capstone | Exile-until-MV≥4 + Paradigm. Reused sos_1/sos_57 conventions. |\n| sos_201 | Lorehold, the Historian | New **miracle** mechanic. **Engine:** `engine/miracle.py` (dynamic grant), `cast_spell_alternative` (Reviewer-driven strict fix for natural-draw + non-sticky grant). |\n| sos_226 | Silverquill, the Disputant | New **casualty** mechanic. **Engine:** `cast_spell` now fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`; copy w/ new targets. |\n| sos_245 | Witherbloom, the Balancer | Affinity for creatures + granted affinity. **Engine:** `get_cost_reduction` folds in battlefield grants. |\n| sos_257 | Great Hall of the Biblioplex | Manland animation + granted +1/+0 cast trigger. No engine change. |\n\n**Notable arbitration decisions (logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` / `RUN_DECISIONS.md`):**\n- Sided with the Reviewer twice on strict issues (sos_97 turn-skip must actually execute; sos_201 miracle must fire on naturally-drawn cards and not be sticky) — both fixed in revision rounds with no disagreements.\n- Accepted two documented gaps: sos_226 casualty excludes the source creature (forced by pinned test design; Reviewer confirmed no rules-accurate alternative passes the tests), and sos_257's \"spend mana only on instant/sorcery\" restriction is unenforced (codebase-wide engine limitation matching FDN 267).\n- All new mechanics were surfaced via attributes/methods rather than `Keyword` enum members to respect the pinned `len(Keyword)==16` engine test.\n\nEach new mechanic built reusable engine surfaces that later cards leveraged (e.g. sos_226's `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` firing enabled sos_257's cast trigger; sos_57's main-phase event was reused by sos_120)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":164136,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","uuid":"5c201358-1c45-4219-9f62-b73994a1be93","request_id":"req_011CbcXq6MvDEKnCLU3FacNg"}
