trigger. No engine change. |\n\n**Notable arbitration decisions (logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` / `RUN_DECISIONS.md`):**\n- Sided with the Reviewer twice on strict issues (sos_97 turn-skip must actually execute; sos_201 miracle must fire on naturally-drawn cards and not be sticky) — both fixed in revision rounds with no disagreements.\n- Accepted two documented gaps: sos_226 casualty excludes the source creature (forced by pinned test design; Reviewer confirmed no rules-accurate alternative passes the tests), and sos_257's \"spend mana only on instant/sorcery\" restriction is unenforced (codebase-wide engine limitation matching FDN 267).\n- All new mechanics were surfaced via attributes/methods rather than `Keyword` enum members to respect the pinned `len(Keyword)==16` engine test.\n\nEach new mechanic built reusable engine surfaces that later cards leveraged (e.g. sos_226's `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` firing enabled sos_257's cast trigger; sos_57's main-phase event was reused by sos_120).","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5ed3988e-944a-4908-bc92-4f8937d76445","total_cost_usd":32.398198749999985,"usage":{"input_tokens":221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147478,"cache_read_input_tokens":9656744,"output_tokens":83785,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147478,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1235,"cache_read_input_tokens":164136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":713,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000793,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":12203,"outputTokens":511838,"cacheReadInputTokens":52919860,